            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 2,
              "start": 2
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "In 2017, Abdulkadir Masharipov carried out a terrorist attack on the Reina nightclub in Istanbul, Turkey, on behalf of ISIS, a designated foreign terrorist organization."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "cdc4dd9267003bf8e776f7557a8afa5d9050f30f6326821aa37709120a62cb19",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-cdc4dd926700-0001-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 15,
              "start": 15
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Under 28\u202fU.S.C.\u202f\u00a7\u202f2333(d)(2) (JASTA), a plaintiff must show that the defendant knowingly provided substantial assistance to an act of international terrorism."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Thomas",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "dd6c3d8c307d304d7a04ee78c68af1c21a48a0a3e9724f757c9fd311bc316cdd",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-dd6c3d8c307d-0000-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 7,
              "start": 6
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Thomas, the Court identified the key legal question as whether knowledge of the specific Reina attacks is required for liability under JASTA."
      }
    ],
