          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Thomas asked whether the analysis required knowledge of the specific Reina attacks rather than general knowledge of terrorism."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Chief Justice Roberts",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "dd6c3d8c307d304d7a04ee78c68af1c21a48a0a3e9724f757c9fd311bc316cdd",
