          }
        ],
        "text": "Plaintiffs sued Facebook, Google, and Twitter, alleging the companies aided and abetted ISIS in the 2017 Reina nightclub attack under the Justice Against Sponsors of Terrorism Act (JASTA)."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "cdc4dd9267003bf8e776f7557a8afa5d9050f30f6326821aa37709120a62cb19",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-cdc4dd926700-0000-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 2,
              "start": 2
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The district court dismissed the complaint for failure to state a claim, but the Ninth Circuit reversed that dismissal."
      }
    ],
