              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "Defendants argue that merely providing a platform does not constitute culpability; the \u201cact of international terrorism\u201d element alone is insufficient for liability."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Defendant (Waxman)",
          "citations": [
            {
