              "pages": {
                "end": 33,
                "start": 33
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Defendant (Waxman), according to Defendant (Waxman), defendants contend that without specific knowledge of particular posts used to plan the attack, they cannot be found to have knowingly provided substantial assistance."
        }
